# A rebind that rescans membership but keeps the old copy's accumulator slots
# counts every key once from each copy after the cutover.
MODULE: NoDuplicateContributionRebindKeepsSlots
TARGET: NoDuplicateContribution
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the rebind rebuilds membership from the new copy but keeps the old slots
PERTURBS: Rebind

--- FIND
    /\ ~Live
    /\ Rebuild(Scan(phys))
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~Live
    /\ mem' = Scan(phys)
    /\ read' = Len(wal[phys]) /\ checkpoint' = Len(wal[phys])
    /\ bound' = phys /\ viewDefn' = defn /\ genCopy' = phys
    /\ UNCHANGED <<slots, applied, barrier>>
--- END
